# Checklists

## Pre-Commit

- [ ] `python -m pytest tests/ -v` passes
- [ ] No hardcoded secrets or API keys
- [ ] Type hints on new public APIs
- [ ] Config changes in YAML, not source
- [ ] No new dependencies unless necessary (ponytail)

## PR Checklist

- [ ] Clear description of change and motivation
- [ ] Risk assessment for live trading impact (if touching engine, risk, execution)
- [ ] Config changes documented in PR description
- [ ] Tests added/updated for non-trivial logic
- [ ] No `ccxt` usage introduced

## New Strategy Checklist

- [ ] Extends `BaseStrategy` with `analyze()` and `get_preferred_regimes()`
- [ ] Params in `config/strategies.yaml`
- [ ] Registered in `src/strategies/selector.py`
- [ ] Tests in `tests/test_strategies.py`
- [ ] Regime preferences align with strategy logic

## Live Trading Change Checklist

- [ ] Paper/testnet validated first
- [ ] Circuit breaker behavior unchanged or explicitly documented
- [ ] Position sizing and risk limits reviewed
- [ ] Idempotency preserved for order placement
- [ ] Reconciliation path tested after crash scenarios

## Dashboard/API Change Checklist

- [ ] JSON error format: `{"error": "message"}`
- [ ] No breaking changes to existing endpoints without migration note
